      "text" : "^777700(She moved close to me)^000000",
      "translation" : "^777700（她凑近了我）^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Reckless Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The Paros Lighthouse here collapsed for some unknown reason some time ago, and there's a lot of stuff underneath it.",
      "translation" : "不知什么原因，帕罗斯灯塔前阵子坍塌了，下面还埋着许多东西。"
