      "npc" : "Reckless Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "All right, Just one thing, I'm inexperienced and a novice adventurer. So I'll help you explore down there by guiding you from somewhere safe.",
      "translation" : "好吧，不过有件事先说好：我经验不足，还是个新手冒险者。所以我会待在安全的地方，为你带路，帮你探索下面。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Reckless Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[ Reckless Explorer ]",
      "translation" : "[鲁莽的探险家]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Reckless Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm an adventure tour, and you can explore it yourself. Aren't we compatible with each other? Then, let's get started when you're ready.",
      "translation" : "我会作为探险向导，你可以自己探索。我们不是很合拍吗？准备好后就出发吧。"
